{"assets":["/statement-assets/79eee0d539c2c4272f5572253fe77b9778ada3444b168f163908991bf33448e3.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"568","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. New Language"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Living in Byteland was good enough to begin with, but the good king decided to please his subjects and to introduce a national language. He gathered the best of wise men, and sent an expedition to faraway countries, so that they would find out all about how a language should be designed."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After some time, the wise men returned from the trip even wiser. They locked up for six months in the dining room, after which they said to the king: \"there are a lot of different languages, but almost all of them have letters that are divided into vowels and consonants; in a word, vowels and consonants must be combined correctly.\""}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are very many rules, all of them have exceptions, but our language will be deprived of such defects! We propose to introduce a set of formal rules of combining vowels and consonants, and include in the language all the words that satisfy them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The rules of composing words are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The letters are divided into vowels and consonants in some certain way;"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" All words have a length of exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" rules of the form ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pos1, t1, pos2, t2"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Each rule is: if the position "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pos1"},{"kind":"text","text":" has a letter of type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t1"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the position "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pos2"},{"kind":"text","text":" has a letter of type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given some string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", it is not necessarily a correct word of the new language. Among all the words of the language that lexicographically not smaller than the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":", find the minimal one in lexicographic order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single line consisting of letters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (Vowel) and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (Consonant), determining which letters are vowels and which letters are consonants. The length of this string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the size of the alphabet of the new language ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ l ≤ 26"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" letters of the English alphabet are used as the letters of the alphabet of the new language. If the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character of the string equals to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', then the corresponding letter is a vowel, otherwise it is a consonant."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 200"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ m ≤ 4n(n - 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of letters in a single word and the number of rules, correspondingly."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" rules of the language in the following format: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pos1, t1, pos2, t2"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ pos1, pos2 ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pos1 ≠ pos2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/79eee0d539c2c4272f5572253fe77b9778ada3444b168f163908991bf33448e3.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"}"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The last line contains string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", consisting of the first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" small letters of the English alphabet."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that no two rules are the same."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a smallest word of a language that is lexicographically not smaller than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":". If such words does not exist (for example, if the language has no words at all), print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"-1\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (without the quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"VC\n2 1\n1 V 2 C\naa\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"ab\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"VC\n2 1\n1 C 2 V\nbb\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"VCC\n4 3\n1 C 2 V\n2 C 3 V\n3 V 4 V\nabac\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"acaa\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test word "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"aa\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not a word of the language, but word "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test out of all four possibilities only word "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"bb\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not a word of a language, but all other words are lexicographically less, so there is no answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test, due to the last rule, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"abac\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" doesn't belong to the language ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"a\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a vowel, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"c\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a consonant). The only word with prefix "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" that meets the given rules is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"abaa\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". But it is less than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"abac\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", so the answer will be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"acaa\""}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"568C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/568/problem/C"}